	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_00_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>げんざい　ランク　[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]
『[Name:ResortGreet Idx="2" ]』です▼
つぎの　ランクまで
にんきは　あと[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]ひつようです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T06:11:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>現在　ランク　[Digit:2digits Idx="0" ]
『[Name:ResortGreet Idx="2" ]』です▼
次の　ランクまで
人気は　あと[Digit:4digits Idx="1" ]必要です▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-26T06:44:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T06:11:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
