		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="resort_secretary_talk_02_f"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:ResortShop ]！
すばらしい▼
[Name:ResortShop ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]にひらいたら▽
きっと　ゆうめいに　なります▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-15T07:05:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
