				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:ResortShop ]！
すばらしい▼
[Name:ResortShop ]を
[Name:ResortTown Idx="1" ]にひらいたら▽
きっと　有名に　なります▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-26T06:43:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
