				Time="2011-09-17T07:57:29" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>兄弟は？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
